   "difficulty": 2,
   "stem_html": "<p>What is the value of</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"fr\"><span><span class=\"rt\">√<span class=\"ov\">5</span></span> + 2</span><span><span class=\"rt\">√<span class=\"ov\">5</span></span> − 2</span></span> − <span class=\"fr\"><span><span class=\"rt\">√<span class=\"ov\">5</span></span> − 2</span><span><span class=\"rt\">√<span class=\"ov\">5</span></span> + 2</span></span> ?</p>",
   "diagram_svg": null,
   "options": {
    "A": "8",
    "B": "4<span class=\"rt\">√<span class=\"ov\">5</span></span>",
    "C": "9 + 4<span class=\"rt\">√<span class=\"ov\">5</span></span>",
    "D": "18",
    "E": "8<span class=\"rt\">√<span class=\"ov\">5</span></span>"
   },
   "answer": "E",
   "solution_html": "<p>Rationalise: <span class=\"fr\"><span><span class=\"rt\">√<span class=\"ov\">5</span></span> + 2</span><span><span class=\"rt\">√<span class=\"ov\">5</span></span> − 2</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span>(<span class=\"rt\">√<span class=\"ov\">5</span></span> + 2)<sup>2</sup></span><span>5 − 4</span></span> = 9 + 4<span class=\"rt\">√<span class=\"ov\">5</span></span>. Similarly <span class=\"fr\"><span><span class=\"rt\">√<span class=\"ov\">5</span></span> − 2</span><span><span class=\"rt\">√<span class=\"ov\">5</span></span> + 2</span></span> = 9 − 4<span class=\"rt\">√<span class=\"ov\">5</span></span>.</p><p>Difference = <span class=\"key\">8<span class=\"rt\">√<span class=\"ov\">5</span></span></span>.</p>",
   "traps": {
    "A": "8 drops the √5 from 4√5 − (−4√5).",
    "B": "4√5 is one of the two surd parts; the subtraction doubles it.",
    "C": "This is the first fraction alone.",
    "D": "18 is the sum of the two fractions, not the difference."
   },
   "detail": "Surds"
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "topic": "Surds, indices, logarithms & exponentials",
