   "solution_html": "<p>10(2<span class=\"math\">a</span> + 19<span class=\"math\">d</span>) = 610 and 5(2<span class=\"math\">a</span> + 9<span class=\"math\">d</span>) = 155, so 2<span class=\"math\">a</span> + 19<span class=\"math\">d</span> = 61 and 2<span class=\"math\">a</span> + 9<span class=\"math\">d</span> = 31. Subtract: 10<span class=\"math\">d</span> = 30, <span class=\"math\">d</span> = 3, <span class=\"math\">a</span> = 2.</p><p>15th term = 2 + 14 × 3 = <span class=\"key\">44</span>.</p>",
