   "stem_html": "<p>How many real solutions does the equation</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">4<sup><span class=\"math\">x</span></sup> + 6<sup><span class=\"math\">x</span></sup> = 2 × 9<sup><span class=\"math\">x</span></sup></p><p>have?</p>",
